Spam Classifier Thinking

Features (Inputs)
-Email text
-Sender address
-Number of links
-Keywords (free, offer, win)
-Message length

Data Needed
-Spam emails
-Normal emails
-Labeled dataset (spam / not spam)
-Email subject + body

Possible Mistakes
1.Important email marked as spam
2.Spam email classified as normal
3.Short messages misclassified
4.Promotional emails treated as spam
5.New spam patterns not detected
